The final draft of the quarterly numbers is attached. Revenue grew in every
quarter, with the largest jump between the third and the fourth.

Every region is broken out separately this time, which is what the board asked
for after the last review. The central region is the one to watch: it started
the year behind the others and finished ahead of all but the north.

The spreadsheet has one row per region per quarter, so it can be pivoted
without any further work. Nothing in it is rounded.

--INNER
